    "text": "Graph of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0001_3f51b39b9426.jpg\" /><br /><br /><br /><br />and graph of <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0001_ab9a572f8cc6.jpg\" /><br /><br /><br /><br />So area enclosed by two graph is zero.<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0001_3c98def45ca5.jpg\" />"
